      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想拍照也没问题哦！\r\n那边的你，给我扇扇风，表演出月夜里微风轻拂的样子吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "293d05ed9d1e39a8646d719242d191c81f64dc3427325179b3f42c390e5c2f2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
