    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511a96dbbbfbd5cdb5483505",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，那之后的一段时间里，\r\n我被卷入了突如其来的好歌剧摄影会――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1ba4b78be14cec1569e55907f8ea29f6e44fc0ffde4b079f296a0fd866a636c",
