      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……好照片啊！\r\n破坏与创造……希望与绝望……以及美丽的我！　Bravo！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b73195426b8a86a03bc2ef32d1780d0f7f7a0e8df37930a832ebf29ff3dc5700",
