    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25ffd594bf044bcc0787462a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这儿有一张断了一条腿的桌子。\r\n我设法将哭闹着的她安抚下来，并仔细听她讲――",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df546ab2d5143230935d29207bbf00d7d17a2f5e8b44f62e1912ef4590fb8f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
